/E (I am a rising fourth-year medical student applying to Internal Medicine-Pediatrics programs. I also enter my fourth year of volunteering at HAVEN, first as a member of the now-revamped ICDD team \(Fall 2023-Summer 2025\), then as a senior clinical team member \(Fall 2025\), and Clinical Advisor \(Spring 2026\). I am always in awe of the impact of our clinic and the commitment of our volunteers, and I am grateful that we get to continue doing this work together. )
