/P 181 0 R
/E (This year, my hope is that we continue to invest in HAVEN. Investing in the clinic means investing in our patients, our volunteers, and the systems that allow us to provide outstanding care. It means supporting innovative ideas, improving our operations, and creating an environment where volunteers can learn, lead, and make meaningful contributions. In parallel, we will be codifying many of our policies and procedures to make volunteer experiences more consistent, accessible, and sustainable across leadership transitions. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
