/P 184 0 R
/E (What began as a vision from our previous Clinical Advisor, Suyeon Hong, and Volunteer Lenique Huggins. with the support and mentorship of Dr. Starling Haynes, has grown into something much larger. Dermatology Clinic has expanded access to specialty care for patients who might otherwise face significant barriers to treatment, while demonstrating what is possible when innovation meets community need.)
