/E (As healthcare access continues to shift, HAVEN is working to strengthen its role as a bridge to long-term, sustainable care.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
377 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 192 0 R
/E (Over the past semester, we have begun embracing a transitional care model, recognizing that many patients may need support for several years before they are able to establish stable access to insurance, specialty care, and primary care. Rather than serving solely as an entry point into the healthcare system, HAVEN is increasingly focused on helping patients navigate that journey while building strong partnerships with organizations across New Haven.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
378 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 192 0 R
/E (This approach allows us to continue expanding services for patients while remaining committed to an important goal: ensuring every patient has access to a long-term medical home. Whether through Fair Haven Community Health Care, Cornell Scott-Hill Health Center, Yale New Haven Health, or other community partners, we are working to make sure patients receive the right care, at the right time, in the right setting.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
