/T (To help maximize access to appointments, HAVEN has implemented a new no-show policy. Patients who miss multiple scheduled appointments without notice may be asked to reconnect with our team before future visits are scheduled. Our goal is not to create barriers, but to ensure appointment slots are available to patients who need them the most.)
/E (To help maximize access to appointments, HAVEN has implemented a new no-show policy. Patients who miss multiple scheduled appointments without notice may be asked to reconnect with our team before future visits are scheduled. Our goal is not to create barriers, but to ensure appointment slots are available to patients who need them the most.)
