/Title (For Pharmacy Director Nick Bhasin, the initiative began with a simple question: How can HAVEN ensure that patients actually receive the medications they are prescribed? While online pharmacy services already existed, many remained prohibitively expensive, and patients continued to face barriers ranging from transportation challenges to difficulties picking up medications in person.)
