/Title (To improve turnaround times and support the long-term sustainability of our medication assistance programs, HAVEN is re-emphasizing small patient contributions for lower-cost medications \(particularly those under $20\) when financially feasible. This approach helps patients access medications more quickly while allowing HAVEN to continue expanding medication assistance for those with the greatest need.)
