1288 0 obj
<<
/Title (HAVEN has officially lifted its new patient freeze. As we welcome new patients, we remain committed to connecting individuals with the most appropriate source of long-term care while prioritizing those who face the greatest barriers to accessing healthcare. This includes patients referred by community partners, individuals with family members already receiving care at HAVEN, recent arrivals to the country with limited prior medical evaluation, and others facing extenuating circumstances.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 875 0 R
/Prev 1263 0 R
/Next 1292 0 R
>>
