/Title (Healthcare navigation can be overwhelming. Across departments, HAVEN volunteers are working to empower patients with the knowledge and tools they need to advocate for themselves. This includes helping patients complete Free Care applications, understand insurance and healthcare resources, navigate referrals, and connect with services that support their long-term health and well-being.)
/Dest [23 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 875 0 R
/Prev 1288 0 R
